&lt;li&gt;Fast Company Most Innovative Companies (2020, 2023)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fortune Best Workplaces NY (2020, 2021, 2022, 2023, 2024)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Maven is looking for&nbsp;an experienced and dynamic Head of Consultant Relations to lead our efforts in building and maintaining strategic partnerships with healthcare benefit brokers and consultants. The ideal candidate will have a proven track record in the healthcare benefits industry, exceptional relationship-building skills and a deep understanding of the benefits consulting landscape. This role will lead a team of consultant relations professionals and will drive initiatives to enhance our market presence and strengthen our partnerships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will act as a vital liaison between the consultant community and Maven, driving new commercial opportunities and ensuring that insights and feedback from our partners directly inform our strategies and initiatives. This position requires close collaboration with our Growth, Client Success, and Marketing teams to align partnership efforts with overall business goals. The VP will be instrumental in identifying new opportunities, addressing challenges, and enhancing the value we provide to our partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our ideal candidate is a well-connected growth leader with an extensive network of relationships within the broker/consultant channel. They have a proven track record of leveraging these connections to drive successful commercial results. This individual will bring a strategic mindset, exceptional communication skills, and a deep understanding of the dynamics of the benefits consulting landscape. Their ability to foster strong, mutually beneficial relationships will be crucial to our mission of expanding our market presence and delivering superior value to our clients and partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
