&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and cultivate relationships with key healthcare practice and consultant leaders across national and regional consulting firms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and implement a comprehensive partnership strategy to increase commercial opportunities through the consultant/broker channel.&nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with internal stakeholders to align partnership efforts with business objectives and goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Leadership and Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, mentor and develop a team of consultant relation professionals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster a high performance culture, ensuring team members have the necessary skills, resources and support to succeed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set clear goals, expectations and performance metrics for the team, conducting regular evaluations and providing constructive feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Relationship Management:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the primary point of contact for all consultant relations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain strong, ongoing relationships with existing partners and develop new relationships to expand our network.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct regular meetings, presentations, and training sessions with partners to ensure mutual understanding and alignment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Market Insights and Analysis:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay abreast of industry trends, market conditions, and competitive landscape.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide insights and feedback to internal teams to inform product development, marketing strategies, and sales tactics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor partner performance and develop strategies to optimize collaboration and outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
