&lt;li&gt;Highly motivated, results-oriented, and capable of managing multiple priorities in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel as needed to support partnership initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
