&lt;p&gt;The Coherenauts, as we call ourselves, who succeed here are empathetic teammates who are candid, kind, caring, and embody &lt;a href=&quot;https://coherehealth.com/our-story&quot;&gt;our core values and principles&lt;/a&gt;. We believe that diverse, inc

