&lt;li&gt;Define repeatable dev and operational task patterns for client implementations; maintain process documentation in Confluence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure Implementation Managers have clear insight into timelines and any issues that require client support&nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Additionally, the Program Manager will partner with product and engineering management on projects based on skills, experience, and interest — such as sprint/engineering metrics reporting, bug management, dashboards, release notes process improvements, and Jira workflow standardization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll need:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years as a product or program manager or project manager in software, with experience managing implementations or product launches and coordinating cross-functional delivery across product, engineering, and client-facing teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Jira and agile expertise; able to apply tooling and recommend plugins to create a clear source of truth for status, risks, and blockers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Healthcare, health-tech, or complex B2B SaaS implementation background&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable reading engineering scope, design, and estimates to sequence work and manage timelines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communicator who simplifies complexity for technical and non-technical audiences; strong organizational skills managing multiple concurrent workstreams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with health plans and utilization management, is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Jira Project Administrator, Jellyfish, or Monday.com experience, is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using AI automation/Claude for repeatable technical setup tasks (e.g., SFTP, SSO coordination), is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
