&lt;h3&gt;About the Role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GHX’s trading platform handles millions of documents to facilitate business transactions between healthcare providers, suppliers, and trading partners. The Exchange Engineering team is seeking a seasoned Senior Software Engineer to strengthen its Hyderabad team. You will design, develop, and scale the platform that supports millions of transactions, working across the stack in &lt;strong&gt;Java, Spring Boot and Angular&lt;/strong&gt;, and using &lt;strong&gt;AI coding tools and agents&lt;/strong&gt; as a core part of how you build and operate.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Principal Duties and Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define, design, and develop components using &lt;strong&gt;Java, Spring Boot, Angular&nbsp;and AWS Cloud&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement all aspects of development, including database, presentation, middle tier, and system interfaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with architects, Systems Engineering, Product Management, and other technical and non-technical stakeholders throughout the product development lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Formulate and communicate technical vision and strategy to business and technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and develop data architecture, data definitions, and data manipulation structures across MySQL, MongoDB, Elasticsearch, and Redis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work daily with the Agile delivery team and Product, and respond quickly and effectively to changing requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in project planning and provide detailed, accurate estimates.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain system, technical, and architectural documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute architectural design spikes and proof-of-concept implementations, and evaluate third-party software as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform code, design, and architectural reviews, and mentor junior developers on best practices, coding standards, and problem-solving.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with testing and release processes, including writing unit and integration tests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor AWS services and overall system behavior to ensure reliability, performance, and availability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support production issues as required, including on-call support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI tools daily (e.g., GitHub Copilot, Cursor, Claude Code) to accelerate code generation, refactoring, unit test creation, log analysis, anomaly detection, and incident troubleshooting, while ensuring code quality, security, and compliance with organizational standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI-assisted tools to shorten delivery timelines, speed up root cause analysis for production issues, and improve system observability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuously evaluate and adopt emerging AI tools and practices, and coach teammates on responsible AI use.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
