&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BS in Computer Science or a related degree (Math, Engineering, Computers), or equivalent education and experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;6+ years of professional development experience in Java/J2EE.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Java (must-have):&lt;/strong&gt; strong experience with Java/J2EE, Spring, Spring Boot, and Hibernate.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Angular (must-have):&lt;/strong&gt; strong hands-on experience building applications with Angular and TypeScript, plus HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.&lt;/li&gt;
