&lt;li&gt;Strong experience with unit testing frameworks such as JUnit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in system design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with cloud architecture (AWS preferred) and distributed systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience writing unit, integration, automation, and API tests.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem-solving, analytical, and troubleshooting skills, with the ability to work under pressure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and oral communication skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in an Agile/Scrum environment.&lt;/li&gt

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role: Senior Software Engineer (Java + Angular)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Location: Hyderabad, India (Hybrid)&lt;br&gt;Department: Product Development&lt;br&gt;Job Req ID: 1454&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;About GHX:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;GHX&nbsp;(Global Healthcare Exchange) is a leading healthcare technology company on a mission to simplify the business of healthcare and improve patient outcomes. Founded in 2000, GHX has built the GHX Global Network&nbsp;— the world’s largest cloud-based supply chain community connecting healthcare providers, suppliers, distributors, and partners to automate key processes, reduce costs, and increase operational efficiency. Its solutions span electronic trading, procurement automation, inventory and contract management, business intelligence, and data synchronization, helping healthcare organizations improve productivity and focus more on patient care. Over the years, GHX has enabled significant cost savings for the industry and continues to innovate with intelligent automation and AI-driven capabilities.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Website:&nbsp;&lt;a id=&quot;OWAec6365e8-de62-9c7c-a147-e144a48b8cd2&quot; class=&quot;x_x_x_x_OWAAutoLink&quot; href=&quot;https://nam02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.ghx.com%2F&amp;data=05%7C02%7Cvramachandrasattiger%40ghx.com%7C14fff6a1cf1f4e6b539808dea43237ec%7C3c2088fe39694873ac0ddc9f122866b9%7C0%7C0%7C639128733089693745%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C60000%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=IjTcs4x%2F%2BiQDmGIfNr4rbYnpQoWgeQ9hNYpfIhKKPf0%3D&amp;reserved=0&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-auth=&quot;NotApplicable&quot; data-linkindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;https://www.ghx.com/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;LinkedIn:&nbsp;&lt;a id=&quot;OWA25cb8e6c-dac6-df6b-f2fe-e7fde877f304&quot; class=&quot;x_x_x_x_OWAAutoLink&quot; href=&quot;https://nam02.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Fcompany%2Fghx%2F&amp;data=05%7C02%7Cvramachandrasattiger%40ghx.com%7C14fff6a1cf1f4e6b539808dea43237ec%7C3c2088fe39694873ac0ddc9f122866b9%7C0%7C0%7C