&lt;li&gt;Fast Company Most Innovative Companies (2020, 2023)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fortune Best Workplaces NY (2020, 2021, 2022, 2023, 2024)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Maven is looking for a Director, GTM Operations &amp; Architecture will own the strategy, systems, design, and reporting that power Maven&#39;s commercial engine. This role sits at the center of Salesforce administration, accountable for the business requirements and sales processes that drive it, providing the growth team with clean, trusted data and efficient workflows. You will report to the Head of Revenue Operations and partner closely with Salesforce engineering, Commercial Strategy, Sales, and Finance to keep our systems scalable, well-documented, and built for growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a player-coach role. You will have 1-2 direct reports while retaining end-to-end ownership of a few critical domains. The person in this seat will be the functional owner of our GTM tools and processes: defining what the business needs, translating those needs into system requirements, owning prioritization, and driving projects to completion. We are looking for a builder and an operator.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salesforce &amp; GTM Systems Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; The Director will own Salesforce as the system of record for the GTM org, ensuring the platform is configured, automated, and maintained to support the sales process end to end&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Owns the roadmap and end-to-end CRM strategy for Salesforce and adjacent systems&lt;/li&gt;
