&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Truveta&#39;s mission is Saving Lives with Data: helping researchers find cures faster, empowering every clinician to be an expert, and helping families make the most informed decisions about their care. Semantic normalization is where that data becomes usable. Health systems describe the same diagnosis, lab result, or medication in countless ways, and our platform maps each one to a standard medical concept, so researchers can study data from many health systems as one. Every dataset Truveta delivers runs through it.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&quot;335557856&quot;:16777215,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;As a Senior Software Engineer, you will own major pieces of the platform&#39;s next-generation architecture. You will scale the service for both the volume and the variety of its workloads, building a flexible system that keeps pace with Truveta&#39;s growing data volume and expanding range of data sources.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&quot;335557856&quot;:16777215,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
