&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Truveta is seeking a motivated and results-driven Senior Research Analyst to join Truveta Research. Truveta Research is an internal research organization focused on demonstrating what’s possible with Truveta by producing high-interest, high-quality, trusted research. In this role, you will collaborate closely with a broad set of disciplines, including communications, marketing, engineering, product, and fellow researchers to advance what is possible with healthcare data. You will have the opportunity to work with an extensive, high-quality dataset of real-world Electronic Health Records (EHR), encompassing over 130 million patients. You will transform complex datasets into impactful insights and share the results with the world using writing, data visualization, and oral presentations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom: 0px; margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Independently lead end-to-end research studies, including literature review, study design, analysis plan development, data analysis, results interpretation, and dissemination of findings.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Write and maintain data analysis code to process, wrangle, and analyze data, along with documentation detailing analyses performed.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Write reports, conference abstracts, and manuscripts to showcase research methods and outputs for a variety of audiences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Manage multiple projects simultaneously, communicate project status and timelines to key stakeholders, and learn quickly to be able to efficiently produce research outputs across a variety of clinical areas.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Work collaboratively with communications, marketing, clinical researchers, product and engineering teams to drive project success.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Represent researcher input by providing feedback on the development of research solutions that enable clinicians and researchers to address real-world healthcare challenges.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
