&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;A key expectation is not just execution—but&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;imagination&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;: the ability to envision and prototype entirely new ways to use rich patient data to solve meaningful healthcare problems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&quot;335559738&quot;:210,&quot;335559739&quot;:210}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&quot;335559738&quot;:210,&quot;335559739&quot;:210}&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot; data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;3&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Curious and imaginative:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&nbsp;You naturally think beyond existing solutions and&nbsp;ask&nbsp;“what hasn’t been done yet?”&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li sty

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer Facing Research Analyst&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Truveta transforms healthcare into intelligence. Built with and owned by US health systems united by a mission of Saving Lives with Data, Truveta powers breakthrough discoveries, auditable data fit for regulatory submissions, and AI that improves patient care.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;At Truveta, we are building something that has never existed before, bringing together healthcare, science, and technology to tackle some of the most important challenges in human health. Our mission calls us to think big, move with urgency, and build with purpose. We are looking for exceptional people who are energized by hard problems, inspired by the opportunity to improve health, and committed to building a company and culture where talented people can do their best work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our team is a special combination of software, health, and big data experience. We are building a talented team of passionate, mission-oriented, and innovative thinkers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-ogsc=&quot;black&quot;&gt;Truveta was born in the Pacific Northwest, but we have employees who live across the country.&nbsp; Our team enjoys the flexibility of a hybrid model and working from anywhere.&nbsp; In person attendance is required at least once per year for an onsite meeting.&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;For overall team productivity, we optimize meeting hours in the pacific time zone. We avoid scheduling recurring meetings that start after 3pm PT, however, ad hoc meetings occur between 8am-6pm Pacific time. &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#LI-remote&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Need&lt;/strong&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Truveta is rapidly building a talented and diverse team to tackle complex health and technical challenges. Beyond core capabilities, we are seeking problem solvers, passionate and collaborative teammates, and those willing to roll up their sleeves while making a difference. If you are interested in the opportunity to pursue purposeful work, join a mission-driven team, and build a rewarding career while having fun, Truveta may be the perfect fit for you.&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom: 0px; margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;This Opportunity&lt;/span&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom: 0px; margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW176482426 BCX8&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW176482426 BCX8&quot;&gt;This Customer Facing Research Analyst position is a high impact, customer-facing role that requires a diverse set of skills spanning technical execution, applied research methodology, and relationship management. You will work directly with life sciences partners to translate research questions into analytical approaches, execute studies using real-world Electronic Health Record (EHR) data (~120M+ patients), and guide customers in best practices for real-world evidence generation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;You will play a key role in advancing customer research by helping shape analytical approaches, ensuring methodological rigor, and driving projects forward from question to insight. While customers may define or co-develop study protocols, you will provide guidance on study design, bias considerations, statistical approaches, and interpretation of results. This role requires balancing rapid-response analytical support with deeper, more complex investigations, while maintaining a high bar for scientific rigor and customer experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin-bottom: 0px; margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Partner closely with life sciences customers to understand research questions and translate them into analytical approaches&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Required to excel in providing technical analytics support as well as directly working with customers on calls to troubleshooting customer analysis.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Use technical skills to scope out customer analyses requests, produce studies and results using SQL, R and Python within an agreed upon deadline.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Build strong, trusted relationships with customer stakeholders, acting as a key partner in advancing their research goals&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Appl

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clinical Terminologist (&lt;strong&gt;Contract)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Truveta transforms healthcare into intelligence. Built with and owned by US health systems united by a mission of Saving Lives with Data, Truveta powers breakthrough discoveries, auditable data fit for regulatory submissions, and AI that improves patient care.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;At Truveta, we are building something that has never existed before, bringing together healthcare, science, and technology to tackle some of the most important challenges in human health. Our mission calls us to think big, move with urgency, and build with purpose. We are looking for exceptional people who are energized by hard problems, inspired by the opportunity to improve health, and committed to building a company and culture where talented people can do their best work.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our team is a special combination of software, health, and big data experience. We are building a talented team of passionate, mission-oriented, and innovative thinkers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Truveta was born in the Pacific Northwest, but we have employees who live across the country.&nbsp; Our team enjoys the flexibility of a hybrid model and working from anywhere.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;For overall team productivity, we optimize meeting hours in the pacific time zone. We avoid scheduling recurring meetings that start after 3pm PT, however, ad hoc meetings occur between 8am-6pm Pacific time.&nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#LI-remote&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Need&lt;/strong&gt; &nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Truveta is rapidly building a talented and diverse team to tackle complex health and technical challenges. Beyond core capabilities, we are seeking problem solvers, passionate and collaborative teammates, and those willing to roll up their sleeves while making a difference. If you are interested in the opportunity to pursue purposeful work, join a mission-driven team, and build a rewarding career while having fun, Truveta may be the perfect fit for you.&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;  &nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;At Truveta, we believe that high data quality will play a critical role in accomplishing our mission towards saving lives with data. An important component of this work is data normalization in which the medical terminology linking, and terminology management are essential in building deep intelligence empowering the new generation of clinical research.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We are looking for a full-time contract Clinical Terminologist who will help to standardize the data sourced from different health systems. The responsibilities include identifying, creating, or validating mapping between medical terms from various healthcare system to standardized Terminologies and extending them.&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot; data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Education in Medicine or related fields (Nursing, Pharmacy, Clinical laboratory science, Medical Informatics, Medical Research, medical coding, etc.)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot; data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;2+ years of experience in the field.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot; data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;1&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:720,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769226&quot;:&quot;Symbol&quot;,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;multilevel&quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;1+ year of practical application i

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Maven Clinic is the world&#39;s largest virtual clinic for women and families on a mission to make healthcare work for all of us. Through Maven Enterprise, the company partners with more than 2,300 employers and health plans to provide end-to-end women&#39;s and family health programs spanning fertility and family building, maternity and newborn care, parenting and pediatrics, and menopause and midlife — improving clinical outcomes, reducing healthcare costs, and expanding equitable access to high-quality care at scale. Through its consumer platform, Maven provides direct access to virtual care across 30+ specialties, as well as dedicated hormone and GLP-1 care programs purpose-built for women. Founded in 2014 by CEO Kate Ryder, Maven Clinic has raised more than $425 million from leading healthcare and technology investors including General Catalyst, Sequoia, Dragoneer Investment Group, Oak HC/FT, StepStone Group, Icon Ventures, and Lux Capital. Recognized for innovation and industry leadership, Maven has been named to the TIME100 Most Influential Companies, CNBC Disruptor 50, Fast Company&#39;s Most Innovative Companies, and FORTUNE Best Places to Work. Learn more at mavenclinic.com&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An award-winning culture working towards an important mission –&nbsp; Maven Clinic is a recipient of over 30 workplace and innovation awards, including:&nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;TIME 100 Most Influential Companies (2023, 2026)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fortune Change the World (2024)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CNBC Disruptor 50 List (2022, 2023, 2024)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fortune Best Workplaces for Millennials (2024)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fortune Best Workplaces in Health Care (2024)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fast Company Most Innovative Companies (2020, 2023)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fortune Best Workplaces NY (2020, 2021, 2022, 2023, 2024)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role:&nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Maven is looking for a self-motivated, quantitative thinker who will play a critical role in our financial strategy and processes as we scale. Maven’s strategic finance function has broad exposure across the business and shapes strategic and tactical decisions through data-driven insights. You will have the opportunity to work with operations, growth, clinical, and our executive leadership teams as you build a business model from the ground up and drive company strategy through analytics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain operating financial models that 1) provide insights into historical performance via key business drivers and 2) accurately forecast future results through continuous ingestion of actual performance data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Innovate and improve existing infrastructure by identifying areas of opportunity for automation of manual processes&nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be a subject matter expert on complex revenue and cost structures&nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive operational strategy for Executive stakeholders by synthesizing and summarizing financial analysis to provide business insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with departments as a cross-functional partner and ensure leaders are equipped with accurate information to make decisions operational spend and resource allocation decisions&nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support other financial work streams including Board materials, investor reporting, and fundraising activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Bring:&nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3-4 years of financial experience
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1-2 years of experience in banking or venture-capital/growth investment experience AND&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1-2 years of operating finance experience at a tech or healthcare startup&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced Excel and GSheets skills &amp; proficient in Netsuite reporting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Detailed understanding of three statement financials including non-P&amp;L drivers of changes in cash flows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to thrive in ambiguity and fast-paced environments with appropriate prioritization of competing priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and communication skills, with the ability to dive into the details and zoom-out to provide executive-level insights&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health Tech, Healthcare, and/or SaaS&nbsp; experience, ideally within early stage, high growth or subscription-based business models preferred&nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Salesforce, Workday/Adaptive, and Looker preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The base salary range for this role is $149,000 - $175,000 per year. You will also be entitled to receive equity and benefits. Individual pay decisions are based on a number of factors, including qualifications for the role, experience level, and skillset.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role requires active work authorization in the US.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Maven embraces a flexible hybrid work model. Our teams primarily operate from the New York Metropolitan area, NY, and remotely via San Francisco/Bay Area, CA, Seattle, WA. For those in our New York City office, we encourage in-person collaboration by requiring team members to work onsite three days a week&nbsp; (Tuesday, Wednesday, Thursday). For those based in Boston, DC, Chicago, Seattle, and San Francisco, we encourage in-person collaboration by requiring team members to attend monthly Work Together Days within these cities. This policy aims to balance remote work flexibility with the benefits of face-to-face interaction.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;At Maven we believe that a diverse set of backgrounds and experiences enrich our teams and allow us to achieve above and beyond our goals. If you do not have experience in all of the areas detailed above, we hope that you will share your unique background with us in your application and how it can be additive to our teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits That Work For You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our benefits are designed to support your health, well-being and career development, helping you thrive both personally and professionally. We remain focused on providing a competitive benefits package for our employees. On top of standards such as employer-covered health, dental, and insurance plan options, we offer an inclusive approach to benefits:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maven for Mavens: access to the full platform and specialists, including care for mental health, reproductive health, family planning and pediatrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Whole-self care through wellness partnerships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hybrid work, in office meals, and work together days&nbsp;&lt;

&lt;h3&gt;Principal Duties and Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide global legal support on a wide range of commercial transactions, including drafting, reviewing, and negotiating contracts with customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Draft and maintain template agreements; identify gaps and recommend and develop legal and cross-functional contract processes and improvements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review, implement, communicate, enforce, and manage legal contract processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams to support product development and ensure compliance with applicable laws and regulations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide clear, reasoned risk analysis and opportunities related to contracts and new and existing products and services for leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the commercial go-to-market process, ensuring alignment with legal and regulatory requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and develop the company&#39;s intellectual property portfolio, including patents, trademarks, and copyrights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and enforce the commercial legal contracting process to ensure efficiency and compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and implement legal strategies to support business growth and innovation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure compliance with healthcare regulations, data privacy laws, and industry standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and resolve legal disputes and claims in collaboration with external counsel when necessary.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay current on relevant legal developments and industry trends to proactively address potential legal issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide training and support to internal teams on legal and compliance matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Qualifications&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Juris Doctor (JD) degree from an accredited law school.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Active bar membership in good standing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum of 5 years of experience as an in-house commercial counsel, preferably in the healthcare SaaS technology industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of contract law, commercial transactions, and regulatory compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience overseeing go-to-market processes and managing intellectual property portfolios.&lt;/li&gt;
