&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise in AWS (ECS, Lambda, CloudFormation/Terraform, IAM, networking, security controls)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of telemetry data types: metrics, logs, and traces&lt;/li&gt;
