&lt;p&gt;As an early-stage startup, Cohere Health&#39;s marketing efforts span a wide range from demand generation and product marketing to event management, content development, and analyst and media engagement. This role offers an exciting opportunity for an analytical, curious, and highly organized individual to make an immediate impact on Cohere&#39;s growth.&lt;/p&gt;
