&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Marketing Automation &amp; CRM&lt;/strong&gt;: Support segmentation, workflows, campaign management, data hygiene, and ongoing database maintenance across HubSpot and Salesforce.&lt;/li&gt;
