&lt;li&gt;Audit and validate 401(k) contributions to ensure accuracy and compliance with plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Audit employee travel and expense reimbursements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Document payroll-to-recordkeeper transmissions, reconciliations, and audit findings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
