&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to manage a wide range of legal matters and balance risk with business objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong track record of drafting and negotiating commercial contracts, particularly in the technology space&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent verbal and written communication skills, with the ability to translate complex legal concepts into clear, practical guidance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive, solutions-oriented mindset; you don’t just flag issues, you help solve them&lt;/li&gt;
