&lt;li data-start=&quot;1148&quot; data-end=&quot;1222&quot;&gt;Organized, detail-oriented, and comfortable managing multiple priorities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1225&quot; data-end=&quot;1299&quot;&gt;Knowledge of NCQA/CMS standards; proficiency with MCG (CareWebQI a plus)&lt;/li&gt;
