&lt;li data-start=&quot;1384&quot; data-end=&quot;1417&quot;&gt;3+ years of clinical experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1420&quot; data-end=&quot;1466&quot;&gt;Utilization Management experience&lt;/li&gt;
