&lt;li&gt;Build a deep understanding of GHX products and the customer journey across supported ERP systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the key link between engineering, customers, and business teams, working closely with Product Owners, Product Managers, and end users.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate complex business requirements into clear, actionable tasks for engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assess ERP opportunities and customer needs to build business cases and product roadmaps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Convert business needs and customer feedback on ERP integrations into clear product requirements, broken down into releases, epics, and user stories.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write user persona scenarios that illustrate B2B market problems and justify why a requirement is needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with engineering and cross-functional teams to align on scope, effort estimates, and release timelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Explore integration options with various ERP and MMIS systems, partnering with internal teams and external ERP business partners to deliver an optimal customer experience between GHX products and ERP platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
