&lt;li&gt;Identify and communicate risks and issues, and propose mitigation plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay current with industry trends, ERP platform changes, and best practices in integration design and architecture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support business and customer success teams with product expertise and technical guidance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and track KPIs to measure integration effectiveness, user adoption, and customer satisfaction, driving continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with other Technical Product Managers overseeing ERP integrations to share knowledge, align roadmaps, and prioritize work for engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Competencies&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative team player with a strong technical mindset and attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organizational skills, with the ability to resolve conflicts and manage differing viewpoints.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skilled in risk assessment, prioritization, and mitigation planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills with both internal and external customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading meetings, setting agendas, driving decisions, and negotiating.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to navigate complex relationships and balance stakeholder interests to achieve results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of professional experience with technical products, preferably with a B2B integrations background.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience communicating technical solutions to internal and external audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mandatory: experience in ERP integration or B2B integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-directed, with strong initiative and organizational skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sound technical product management skills and a customer-focused mindset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in a related discipline, or an equivalent combination of education and experience.&lt;/li&gt;
