&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;VP of Marketing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Truveta transforms healthcare into intelligence. Built with and owned by US health systems united by a mission of Saving Lives with Data, Truveta powers breakthrough discoveries, auditable data fit for regulatory submissions, and AI that improves patient care.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;At Truveta, we are building something that has never existed before, bringing together healthcare, science, and technology to tackle some of the most important challenges in human health. Our mission calls us to think big, move with urgency, and build with purpose. We are looking for exceptional people who are energized by hard problems, inspired by the opportunity to improve health, and committed to building a company and culture where talented people can do their best work.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our team is a special combination of software, health, and big data experience. We are building a talented team of passionate, mission-oriented, and innovative thinkers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-ogsc=&quot;black&quot;&gt;Truveta was born in the Pacific Northwest, but we have employees who live across the country.&nbsp; Our team enjoys the flexibility of a hybrid model and working from anywhere. In person attendance is required at least once per year for an onsite meeting.&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;For overall team productivity, we optimize meeting hours in the pacific time zone. We avoid scheduling recurring meetings that start after 3pm PT, however, ad hoc meetings occur between 8am-6pm Pacific time. &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#LI-remote&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Who we need&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Truveta is rapidly building a talented and diverse team to tackle complex health and technical challenges. Beyond core capabilities, we are seeking problem solvers, passionate and collaborative teammates, and those willing to roll up their sleeves while making a difference. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;If you are interested in the opportunity to pursue purposeful work, join a mission-driven team, and build a rewarding career while having fun, Truveta may be the perfect fit for you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;This opportunity&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The Vice President of Marketing is a member of the Truveta Leadership Team responsible for setting Truveta’s marketing strategy, building a world-class marketing organization, and driving demand and business growth&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; This leader will own product and growth marketing, including positioning, messaging, go-to-market strategy, market and competitive intelligence, demand generation, and the successful launch and growth of Truveta products and services.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Working closely with Product, Sales, Finance, and other leaders across Truveta, the VP of Marketing will bring deep market and customer insight to business strategy, including product strategy, pricing, packaging, and go-to-market decisions&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; This leader will bring demonstrated expertise in commercializing and monetizing AI and data-driven products, translating complex technology and capabilities into differentiated customer value and scalable growth.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The VP of Marketing will partner closely with Corporate Communications to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;strengthen the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Truveta brand and translate our company narrative into compelling marketing campaigns, content, experiences, and sales enablement for our priority audiences.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-f

&lt;p class=&quot;x_xmsonormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ogsc=&quot;black&quot; data-olk-copy-source=&quot;MessageBody&quot;&gt;GHX is seeking a Software Engineer with strong technical skills and growing experience in designing, developing, and delivering quality software solutions. You will join the Rules and Actions team and report to the Manager of Engineering. The team owns the rules engine at the core of the GHX Exchange platform. That engine evaluates routing and business rules against document events and runs the resulting actions, such as routing, notifications, and document processing, for healthcare supply chain transactions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_xmsonormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ogsc=&quot;black&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ogsc=&quot;black&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate is proficient in Java and the J2EE/Spring stack, has exposure to AWS cloud services and event-driven systems, and is developing skills in CI/CD pipelines and software design patterns.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_xmsonormal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-ogsc=&quot;black&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ogsc=&quot;black&quot;&gt;What You&#39;ll Work On&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_xmsonormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ogsc=&quot;black&quot;&gt;- Build and enhance features in the rules execution service. It consumes EventBus document events, runs the rule engine, and publishes outcomes such as route-found and no-route-found.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_xmsonormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ogsc=&quot;black&quot;&gt;- Implement rule types, specifications, and actions on the shared rules framework and Exchange extension libraries, following established patterns.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_xmsonormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ogsc=&quot;black&quot;&gt;- Support EventBus-driven rules, including MongoDB-backed rule definitions, event matching, and rule caching.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_xmsonormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ogsc=&quot;black&quot;&gt;- Contribute to Intelligent Business Rules (IBR) capabilities such as business-rule statistics and change-request persistence.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_xmsonormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ogsc=&quot;black&quot;&gt;- Develop and maintain rule actions for document handling and integrations, with guidance from senior engineers. Ship changes behind feature flags.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_xmsonormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ogsc=&quot;black&quot;&gt;- Write JUnit 5 and Mockito tests, and help with ongoing monolith decoupling and Java version migrations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_xmsonormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ogsc=&quot;black&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-ogsc=&quot;black&quot;&gt;Duties and Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_xmsonormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ogsc=&quot;black&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ogsc=&quot;black&quot;&gt;- Design and implement scalable, secure, and maintainable software that aligns with business needs and is flexible, reusable, and efficient.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_xmsonormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ogsc=&quot;black&quot;&gt;- Translate ideas into clear, high-quality code under the guidance of senior engineers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_xmsonormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ogsc=&quot;black&quot;&gt;- Contribute to technical design for features and stories. Document your work and follow IT control policies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_xmsonormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ogsc=&quot;black&quot;&gt;- Work with your team and cross-functional partners to address technical dependencies, review ideas and concerns, and deliver high-quality products.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_xmsonormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ogsc=&quot;black&quot;&gt;- Identify issues of limited scope, analyze their impact, and resolve them independently or with guidance from senior team members.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_xmsonormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ogsc=&quot;black&quot;&gt;- Follow best practices for design, development, testing, and Agile workflows.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_xmsonormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ogsc=&quot;black&quot;&gt;- Build professional relationships within the team to support collaboration and knowledge sharing.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_xmsonormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ogsc=&quot;black&quot;&gt;- Develop an understanding of the rules subsystems, their components, and how they interact (EventBus, MongoDB, ConfigSvc, Elasticsearch) to support feature development.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_xmsonormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ogsc=&quot;black&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-ogsc=&quot;black&quot;&gt;Qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_xmsonormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ogsc=&quot;black&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ogsc=&quot;black&quot;&gt;- Minimum of 2–3 years of software development experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_xmsonormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ogsc=&quot;black&quot;&gt;- BS in Computer Science, or similar work experience&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_xmsonormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ogsc=&quot;black&quot;&gt;- 2+ years developing solutions with Java and J2EE technologies (Spring, Maven)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_xmsonormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ogsc=&quot;black&quot;&gt;- Working knowledge of cloud technologies. AWS experience with EC2, SNS, SQS, S3, or Lambda is nice to have.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_xmsonormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ogsc=&quot;black&quot;&gt;- Experience with databases. MongoDB, Elasticsearch, and MySQL are nice to have.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_xmsonormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ogsc=&quot;black&quot;&gt;- Exposure to a rules engine and/or event-driven architecture (event buses, publish/subscribe messaging)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_xmsonormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ogsc=&quot;black&quot;&gt;- Familiarity with AI tools and willingness to learn emerging technologies&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_xmsonormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ogsc=&quot;black&quot;&gt;- Understanding of design best practices, including performance and scalability&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_xmsonormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ogsc=&quot;black&quot;&gt;- Experience working in an Agile/Scrum environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_xmsonormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ogsc=&quot;black&quot;&gt;- Able to work independently on well-defined tasks and collaboratively as part of a team&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;x_xmsonormal&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ogsc=&quot;black&quot;&gt;- Experience delivering moderate-complexity features&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=

&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Regional Executive Director is responsible for managing a team of sales executives within a defined geographic area, ensuring consistent, profitable growth in sales revenues through the recruitment, training, coaching, and motivation of high-performing sales personnel. This role identifies objectives, strategies, and action plans to promote effective customer relationships and grow sales and earnings.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition, this role partners with key individuals at all levels of the customer organization, gaining a full understanding of the customer’s needs and anticipating changes in the business environment. The Regional Executive Director develops and implements selling strategies and tactics to ensure volume and profit objectives are achieved for each assigned business line.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Principal Duties and Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide clear vision and selling/market penetration strategies in development of the overall territory plan.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recruit, coach, mentor, develop, and manage the sales team, which includes the following roles: Strategic Account Executives, Sales Account Managers, and Strategic Account Directors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hold the team accountable for quota attainment, business review activities, and managing expenditures through strong sales processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meet with strategic C-suite and V-level customers and prospects to ensure internal buy-in at the highest level.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Product Management, Marketing, Customer Success, Customer Support, and other internal GHX departments to drive overall customer value and satisfaction.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the funnel and progress against quota by ensuring pipeline is at a multiple of the revenue target and forecasting accuracy is within an acceptable range, as established by GHX guidelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain a fluent understanding of healthcare market trends, the healthcare supply chain, and competitive activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review and report sales activities within the CRM tool.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to meet or exceed sales quotas by managing a diverse team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong leadership, strategic mindset, high-level business acumen, and analytical and negotiation skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to navigate complex solutions with the C-suite and V-level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to hold the team accountable for pipeline and territory management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage deal escalation to the proper level of management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to coach behavior- and deal-based sales skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage to consultative sales methods and solution selling skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of MS Office Suite and CRM applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in business, finance, or a relevant area&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Five years of business experience, including sales team management, with at least two years of successfully selling complex software and/or services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Skilled in sales planning and managing team quotas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-driven and results-oriented with a positive outlook and a clear focus on high quality and business profit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience negotiating contracts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication and presentation skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High energy and customer-focused mentality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of healthcare technology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong executive presence at the VP level and above, with a demonstrated ability to participate seamlessly in discussions with business and technical leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently and to collaborate effectively across functions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven effectiveness working in a collaborative environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effective time management skills and ability to meet deadlines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Willingness to travel up to 75% of the time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Direct people management and development experience, including hiring and performance management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sales management by metrics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with Salesforce.com and InsightSquared&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Healthcare systems, medical, or software solutions sales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with various ERP systems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience selling against competition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The compensation for this role is: $122,930-$163,852 plus commission&nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The base salary range represents the anticipated low and high end of the GHX’s salary range for this position. Actual salaries will vary and will be based on various factors, such as the candidate’s qualifications, skills, competencies, and proficiency for the role. The base salary is one component of GHX’s total compensation package for employees. Other rewards and benefits include health, vision, and dental insurance, accident and life insurance, 401k matching, paid-time off, and education reimbursement, to name a few. To view more details of our benefits, visit us here: https://www.ghx.com/about/careers/&nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;GHX: It&#39;s the way you do business in healthcare&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Global Healthcare Exchange (GHX) enables better patient care and billions in savings for the healthcare community by maximizing automation, efficiency and accuracy of business processes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;GHX is a healthcare business and data automation company, empowering healthcare organizations to enable better patient care and maximize industry savings using our world class cloud-based supply chain technology exchange platform, solutions, analytics and services. We bring together healthcare providers and manufacturers and distributors in North America and Europe - who rely on smart, secure healthcare-focused technology and comprehensive data to automate their business processes and make more informed decisions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;It is our passion and vision for a more operationally efficient healthcare supply chain, helping organizations reduce - not shift - the cost of doing business, paving the way to delivering patient care more effectively. Together we take more than a billion dollars out of the cost of delivering healthcare every year. GHX is privately owned, operates in the United States, Canada and Europe, and employs more than 1000 people worldwide. Our corporate headquarters is in Color

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;About Truveta&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&quot;134245418&quot;:true,&quot;134245529&quot;:true,&quot;335559738&quot;:200,&quot;335559739&quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Truveta is the world&#39;s first health provider-led data platform with a vision of Saving Lives with Data. Our mission is to enable researchers to find cures faster, empower every clinician to be an expert, and help families make the most informed decisions about their care. Achieving Truveta&#39;s ambitious vision requires an incredible team of talented and inspired people with a unique combination of health, software, and big data expertise who share our company values.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;Location - Hyderabad, India.&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;This opportunity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&quot;134245418&quot;:true,&quot;134245529&quot;:true,&quot;335559738&quot;:200,&quot;335559739&quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Join the founding team of the Truveta India Development Center and play a pivotal role in shaping its future. As one of the early members, you will help build and scale a high-impact organization while contributing to the products and platforms that advance healthcare through data and AI. This is an unusual chance to influence both the technical direction and the culture of a growing global engineering hub.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Patients, doctors, and medical researchers deserve to benefit from the large-scale technological innovation and digital intelligence that have driven progress in other industries. In this position you will build online services, automation, and tooling that monitor Truveta&#39;s data and make sure it continues to meet our high-quality standards. The work calls for creative problem solving and a strong appetite for applying AI and machine learning to anomaly detection, supported by statistical methods, to monitor and reason over big data at scale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;Who we need&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&quot;134245418&quot;:true,&quot;134245529&quot;:true,&quot;335559738&quot;:200,&quot;335559739&quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We are looking for software engineers who are excited by the opportunity to improve healthcare in far-reaching ways, and who sit comfortably at the boundary between production engineering and applied machine learning. You will design and ship services rather than notebooks, and you will be expected to explain why a given detection method suits a given data problem, how you evaluated it, and what its false-alert rate costs the people who receive its alerts.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Beyond core capabilities, we are seeking problem solvers, collaborative teammates, and people willing to roll up their sleeves while making a difference. You will learn the healthcare domain quickly, because the quality of clinical data cannot be judged without understanding what the data is meant to represent.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;What you will do&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&quot;134245418&quot;:true,&quot;134245529&quot;:true,&quot;335559738&quot;:200,&quot;335559739&quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;In this role you will:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;Build &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;performant&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt; AI-based anomaly detection and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;monitoring&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt; systems, using machine &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;learning&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt; and supporting statistical methods to analyze big data at scale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;Design, implement, test, deploy, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;operate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;, and tune the online services, automation, and tooling that monitor Truveta&#39;s data, contributing hands-on to every stage of the software development lifecycle.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;Detect and characterize data-quality issues such as missing or late feeds, volume and distribution shifts, schema and contract drift, duplication, and implausible clinical values.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;Develop and evaluate detection approaches, from statistical baselines and time-series methods through machine-learning models, and measure them on precision, recall, and alert usefulness rather than accuracy alone.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;Turn detection output into signals people can act on: alerts with root-cause context, data-quality metrics, and dashboards that engineering and clinical &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&qu

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Are you looking for a role in a company that&#39;s solving one of the greatest challenges of our lifetime?&nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Ophelia helps people end their opioid use and restore their quality of life with respect for their time and dignity. Our mission is to make evidence-based treatments for opioid use disorder (OUD) accessible to everyone... and we&#39;re looking to bring more people onto our team to help us achieve it.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;postings-link&quot; href=&quot;https://ophelia.com/&quot;&gt;Ophelia&lt;/a&gt; is a venture-backed, healthcare startup that helps individuals with OUD by providing FDA-approved medication and clinical care through a telehealth platform. Our approach is discreet, convenient, and affordable. We&#39;ve been successfully operating in 16 states for almost six years and we&#39;re excited to continue our growth. We are a team of physicians, scientists, entrepreneurs, researchers and White House advisors, backed by leading technology and healthcare investors working to re-imagine and re-build OUD treatment in America.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ophelia is hiring a Manager, Expansion Implementations to run the day-to-day execution of the partnership arrangements that drive our growth. Some of this work follows a familiar path. Some of it is new to us. In both cases, you&#39;ll be the person who keeps the work organized, the right people in the room, and everyone clear on what happens next and by when.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll have support and direction from leadership, who negotiate and close our partnership agreements. Once a contract is signed, your job is to take it to go-live: turning the agreed terms into a clear plan and a well-run, well-communicated launch.&nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re looking for an organized, enthusiastic project manager who enjoys bringing structure to cross-functional work and seeing it through from concept to steady-state operations. Experience in client-facing project management and relationship management is essential. A “run through walls” mindset would position you well for success!&nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll report to the Senior Director, Payor Strategy &amp; Contracting and work on a cross-functional team growing Ophelia&#39;s business across payors, new government programs, and strategic partnerships.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead payor and partner implementations from kickoff through go-live, working with internal and external stakeholders along the way. Stakeholders may include subject matter exports or executives.&nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Start new initiatives by working out what is needed based on the contract and client type: who should be involved, what questions need answers, and what a reasonable implementation plan looks like, etc. Bring a draft plan and key questions to functional area leads so they can react to it, revise timelines, and resolve unknowns together with you&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep project plans, trackers and minute logs accurate and current, including dependencies and status&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership of implementation open questions and action items. Collaborate with colleagues or external parties, as appropriate, to resolve each one in a timely manner; revise project plan and timeline as applicable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work comfortably with the leadership team, including presenting updates, raising risks, and bringing decisions that need their input&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set clear process metrics and SMART goals to manage the team against. Similarly, coordinate with external partners on timelines, targets and operations.&nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quarterback resolution of revenue cycle issues, such as claims processing and credentialing, with external and internal operations teams during implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4-6 years of experience in project management or implementation roles, with growing responsibility over time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep knowledge of managed care contracts and / or provider relationships, ideally related to Medicaid&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of provider credentialing, revenue cycle management, and / or claims submission&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Energized by spearheading new and ambitious implementations without existing playbooks; able to help functional area leads reach informed implementation decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record of running projects on time, on budget, and within scope&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The habit of spotting blockers early and raising them before they slow the project down&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to influence internal and external parties without direct authority, but rather through trust, candid communication, and consistent follow-through&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear written and verbal communication, adjusted to who is reading or listening&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Quick learner and ability to implement a variety of client relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience helping launch a new type of program or partnership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
