&lt;p&gt;This role is responsible for Maven’s end-to-end benefits and payments platform, including eligibility and enrollments.&nbsp; Maven’s benefits products should be easy to use for members, providers and employers. You will work closely with Engineering and Design teams, as well as with Maven’s Growth and Client Success teams, and with clients.&nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
