&lt;li class=&quot;public-DraftStyleDefault-unorderedListItem public-DraftStyleDefault-depth0 public-DraftStyleDefault-lis

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The Executive Director, Product Management – Supply Chain Resiliency reports to the VP, Product Management and owns the full product development lifecycle and go-to-market execution for GHX&#39;s Supply Resiliency Platform — the cross-application layer spanning two use-case tracks: Procure-to-Pay (hospital) and Order-to-Cash (manufacturer/supplier) workflows. This is a build-and-commercialize role: the Executive Director owns the platform requirements, product launch, and forward-deployed pilot through general availability, driving pilot customer selection and execution, product requirements and roadmap, commercial packaging and pricing, and cross-functional GTM alignment across Engineering, forward-deployed teams, Sales, Marketing, Implementation, Professional Services, Customer Care and Finance.&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Areas of focus include, but are not solely limited to: pilot program design and stage-gate governance; product definition, roadmap execution, and technical alignment; commercial packaging, pricing, and profitability; competitive positioning; cross-functional consensus building; and executive/steering-committee reporting.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;WHY THIS ROLE MATTERS&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&quot;134245418&quot;:true,&quot;134245529&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:280,&quot;335559739&quot;:120,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Healthcare supply chain resiliency is now a contested category: well-funded, AI-native challengers are selling point solutions directly to hospitals. This role is chartered to win that fight — turning GHX&#39;s two-sided network of 600+ connected providers and their suppliers into a resiliency platform that out-executes single-sided competitors on speed, breadth, and proven customer outcomes. The Executive Director owns that competitive outcome end to end, from platform definition through GA and beyond.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;KEY RESPONSIBILITIES&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&quot;134245418&quot;:true,&quot;134245529&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:280,&quot;335559739&quot;:120,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Working with a broad group of stakeholders and partners — across GHX product pods, Forward-Deployed Engineering, current and prospective pilot customers, and the executive leadership team — the Executive Director develops and leads GHX Product Management execution for the Supply Resiliency use case. Responsibilities also include identification and qualification of future use case prioritization.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Specific responsibilities include:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:160,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;18&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;•&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Own end-to-end product development lifecycle (PDLC) for GHX Orchestration, from forward-deployed pilot and prototype through GA commercialization, across both use-case tracks (Procure-to-Pay and Order-to-Cash).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&quot;134233279&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:80,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;18&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;•&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;2&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Design, govern, and continuously refine the pilot selection engine: Layer 1 binary hard gates (data access, SME time, on-site access, feedback cadence, executive sponsor) and the Layer 2 weighted scorecard used to rank and select pilot candidates.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&quot;134233279&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:80,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;18&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;•&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;3&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Own pilot cohort selection and all stage-gate decisions (entry, mid-pilot, exit), including go/kill/reallocate calls on stalled accounts.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&quot;134233279&quot;:false,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559739&quot;:80,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;•&quot; data-font=&quot;&quot; data-listid=&quot;18&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&quot;335552541&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:360,&quot;335559991&quot;:360,&quot;469769242&quot;:[8226],&quot;469777803&quot;:&quot;left&quot;,&quot;469777804&quot;:&quot;•&quot;,&quot;469777815&quot;:&quot;hybridMultilevel&quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;4&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Partner directly with the

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Maven Clinic is the world&#39;s largest virtual clinic for women and families on a mission to make healthcare work for all of us. Through Maven Enterprise, the company partners with more than 2,300 employers and health plans to provide end-to-end women&#39;s and family health programs spanning fertility and family building, maternity and newborn care, parenting and pediatrics, and menopause and midlife — improving clinical outcomes, reducing healthcare costs, and expanding equitable access to high-quality care at scale. Through its consumer platform, Maven provides direct access to virtual care across 30+ specialties, as well as dedicated hormone and GLP-1 care programs purpose-built for women. Founded in 2014 by CEO Kate Ryder, Maven Clinic has raised more than $425 million from leading healthcare and technology investors including General Catalyst, Sequoia, Dragoneer Investment Group, Oak HC/FT, StepStone Group, Icon Ventures, and Lux Capital. Recognized for innovation and industry leadership, Maven has been named to the TIME100 Most Influential Companies, CNBC Disruptor 50, Fast Company&#39;s Most Innovative Companies, and FORTUNE Best Places to Work. Learn more at mavenclinic.com&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An award-winning culture working towards an important mission –&nbsp; Maven Clinic is a recipient of over 30 workplace and innovation awards, including:&nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;TIME 100 Most Influential Companies (2023, 2026)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fortune Change the World (2024)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CNBC Disruptor 50 List (2022, 2023, 2024)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fortune Best Workplaces for Millennials (2024)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fortune Best Workplaces in Health Care (2024)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fast Company Most Innovative Companies (2020, 2023)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fortune Best Workplaces NY (2020, 2021, 2022, 2023, 2024)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h4 data-section-id=&quot;1wct3r9&quot; data-start=&quot;146&quot; data-end=&quot;163&quot;&gt;About the Role:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;165&quot; data-end=&quot;464&quot;&gt;This is a senior individual contributor role with significant strategic ownership. You’ll build and run the full lifecycle engine for Maven’s consumer products—from first touch through long-term retention—working alongside a lean, cross-functional team of engineers, product managers, and marketers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;466&quot; data-end=&quot;627&quot;&gt;We’re looking for someone equally comfortable white boarding a six-month lifecycle roadmap as they are urgently debugging why a Braze canvas trigger isn’t firing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do:&nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;ks7vwn&quot; data-start=&quot;818&quot; data-end=&quot;1082&quot;&gt;Architect and own the full consumer lifecycle roadmap, from pre-purchase nurture and conversion flows through post-purchase engagement, win-back, and healthcare-specific journeys such as Rx notifications, refill reminders, and clinical milestone communications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1jedodn&quot; data-start=&quot;1083&quot; data-end=&quot;1253&quot;&gt;Lead lifecycle go-to-market for new program launches, owning the full communications plan from pre-launch nurture through post-launch engagement and ongoing retention&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;916pvn&quot; data-start=&quot;1254&quot; data-end=&quot;1432&quot;&gt;Build and operate automated flows directly in Braze across email, SMS, push, and in-app channels, including complex segmentation, Liquid logic personalization, and journey QA&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;dw2v6p&quot; data-start=&quot;1433&quot; data-end=&quot;1609&quot;&gt;Act as a system steward for lifecycle infrastructure: maintain journey hygiene, integration health, and a clean, scalable Braze architecture as the consumer product evolves&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;19oeozm&quot; data-start=&quot;1610&quot; data-end=&quot;1802&quot;&gt;Partner closely with engineering on event schema design, data triggers, and Braze integrations; write requirements for backend events, read data specs, and debug why triggers aren’t firing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;wg59if&quot; data-start=&quot;1803&quot; data-end=&quot;1953&quot;&gt;Design and use AI-assisted tools to draft email copy and rapidly prototype designs, then route through Maven’s content and design teams for review&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;rw4vj2&quot; data-start=&quot;1954&quot; data-end=&quot;2054&quot;&gt;Maintain and evolve a modular email design system to ensure production remains fast and scalable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1mdomwp&quot; data-start=&quot;2055&quot; data-end=&quot;2265&quot;&gt;Own the lifecycle experimentation program: design A/B tests across subject lines, copy, timing, and flow logic; analyze results rigorously; and report on what is truly driving conversion, retention, and LTV&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1mpepjp&quot; data-start=&quot;2266&quot; data-end=&quot;2486&quot;&gt;Monitor funnel performance proactively and translate insights into roadmap recommendations; identify drop-off patterns, onboarding friction, and engagement gaps, and advocate for product improvements with the PM team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1uay1gb&quot; data-start=&quot;2487&quot; data-end=&quot;2707&quot;&gt;Close the feedback loop between member behavior and content strategy by analyzing replies, unsubscribe signals, and engagement data to surface qualitative insights that inform product, clinical, and content messaging&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;xh4nx7&quot; data-start=&quot;2708&quot; data-end=&quot;2890&quot;&gt;Ensure all lifecycle communications meet HIPAA and healthcare compliance requirements, with a strong understanding of how to communicate sensitively in a regulated health context&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;qkvyg7&quot; data-start=&quot;2891&quot; data-end=&quot;3047&quot;&gt;Collaborate cross-functionally with product, engineering, clinical, and content teams to ensure lifecycle is fully integrated into the member experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;161xh08&quot; data-start=&quot;3076&quot; data-end=&quot;3236&quot;&gt;5–8 years of experience in lifecycle marketing, with meaningful time in DTC health, wellness, or similarly trust-sensitive and regulated consumer categories&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1rt6r0d&quot; data-start=&quot;3237&quot; data-end=&quot;3496&quot;&gt;Deep fluency across the full DTC lifecycle funnel: acquisition nurture, abandoned checkout/consultation, post-purchase onboarding, win-back, loyalty, and healthcare-specific journeys such as Rx management, refill reminders, and clinical p

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;134245418&quot;:true,&quot;134245529&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:200,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Aliases:&lt;/strong&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Senior EHR Data Implementation Analyst (Epic/Cerner), Lead, Healthcare Data Exchange and Interoperability, Senior Clinical Data Mapping and Integration Analyst, Healthcare Data Ingestion and Interoperability Engineer, Senior Clinical Informatics Analyst - Data Integration, Healthcare Implementation Consultant - Data.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;About Truveta&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;134245418&quot;:true,&quot;134245529&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;:1,&quot;335559685&quot;:0,&quot;335559737&quot;:0,&quot;335559738&quot;:200,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:276}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Truveta is the world&#39;s first health provider led data platform with a vision of Saving Lives with Data. Our mission is to enable researchers to find cures faster, empower every clinician to be an expert, and help families make the most informed decisions about their care. Achieving Truveta&#39;s ambitious vision requires an incredible team of talented and inspired people with a special combination of health, software and big data experience who share our company values.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Truveta was born in the Pacific Northwest in the USA and has employees who live across the country. As we expand our global footprint with a new presence in Hyderabad, India, we&#39;re building a world-class team to help us scale this mission, and high-quality, well-integrated health data is at the heart of everything we do.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;This job requires daily onsite work at our headquarters in Hyderabad, India.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;Who We Need&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&quot;134245418&quot;:true,&quot;134245529&quot;:true,&quot;335559738&quot;:200,&quot;335559739&quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Truveta is rapidly building a talented and diverse team to tackle complex health and technical challenges. Beyond core capabilities, we are seeking problem solvers, passionate and collaborative teammates, and those willing to roll up their sleeves while making a difference. If you are interested in the opportunity to pursue purposeful work, join a mission-driven team, and build a rewarding career while having fun, Truveta may be the perfect fit for you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;This Opportunity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&quot;134245418&quot;:true,&quot;134245529&quot;:true,&quot;335559738&quot;:200,&quot;335559739&quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We are seeking a Senior Healthcare Data Integration Analyst to lead and support the onboarding of member data into the Truveta platform. This role is central to ensuring high-quality, well-integrated data that meets clinical, research, and operational needs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate is passionate about working with complex healthcare datasets, uncovering patterns in disparate source systems, and building scalable processes that make downstream analytics efficient and reliable. You will work closely with external member teams and internal engineering stakeholders to profile, map, validate, and automate data ingestion workflows, bringing hands-on experience with clinical applications such as Epic, Cerner, MEDITECH, or Allscripts and with healthcare data standards including HL7, FHIR, and CCDA.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Working from the Truveta India Development Center, you will partner every day with engineering, product, and member teams in the United States, so regular overlap with US Pacific (West Coast) business hours is part of the role.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&quot;134245418&quot;:true,&quot;134245529&quot;:true,&quot;335559738&quot;:200,&quot;335559739&quot;:0}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;Lead o&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;nboarding of data from member source systems and third-party sources into the Truveta platform.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;Partner with external technical and clinical teams to understand source data structures, workflows, and business &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;context&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&gt;Perform comprehensive data profiling to assess completeness, quality, conformance, and integrity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;List Bullet&quot;&g

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Are you looking for a role in a company that&#39;s solving one of the greatest challenges of our lifetime?&nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Ophelia helps people end their opioid use and restore their quality of life with respect for their time and dignity. Our mission is to make evidence-based treatments for opioid use disorder (OUD) accessible to everyone... and we&#39;re looking to bring more people onto our team to help us achieve it.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;postings-link&quot; href=&quot;https://ophelia.com/&quot;&gt;Ophelia&lt;/a&gt; is a venture-backed, healthcare startup that helps individuals with OUD by providing FDA-approved medication and clinical care through a telehealth platform. Our approach is discreet, convenient, and affordable. We&#39;ve been successfully operating in 16 states for almost six years and we&#39;re excited to continue our growth. We are a team of physicians, scientists, entrepreneurs, researchers and White House advisors, backed by leading technology and healthcare investors working to re-imagine and re-build OUD treatment in America.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ophelia&#39;s Community Partnership Managers (CPMs) are the boots-on-the-ground function of our B2B growth strategy, building and managing relationships with community-based organizations, health systems, payors, and correctional facilities who refer patients into Ophelia&#39;s care. The team has grown from 3 CPMs in January 2026 to 10+ today, expanding across Pennsylvania, New Jersey, and New York, with additional markets on the horizon. Each CPM owns a territory end-to-end (sourcing new partnerships and managing existing ones) and the team as a whole has driven steady, organic growth in patient referral volume as it&#39;s scaled.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Team growth has outpaced the operational support model built for a much smaller team. We need someone who can absorb the recurring, high-volume work that currently sits with the Sr. Director of Partnerships (e.g., 1:1 action items across a growing team, playbook upkeep, CRM hygiene, and fast-turnaround data requests) so that CPMs have the support to maximize their impact in the field.&nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is ideal for someone who&#39;s equally comfortable being the project manager to chase down loose ends and the analyst who can pull an insightful dataset to guide decision making. You&#39;ll work directly with the Sr. Director of Partnerships and touch every part of the CPM function.&nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Execution &amp; Follow-Through&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Request Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive action items from the Sr. Director&#39;s weekly CPM and cross-functional meetings, plus other one-off needs from the team, end-to-end.&nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collateral Management: &lt;/strong&gt;Curate the team&#39;s partner-facing collateral library (e.g., organizing existing materials, flagging what&#39;s outdated, and making light updates directly).&nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tracking &amp; Visibility:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain a single running log across 10+ reps&#39; worth of requests so nothing falls through the cracks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Playbook Ownership &amp; Documentation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Playbook Upkeep:&lt;/strong&gt; Own the weekly review cycle for the CPM playbook; keeping it accurate and structuring new content as the team scales into new markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Source of Truth:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain it as the team&#39;s genuine source of truth, not just a reference doc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data, Analytics &amp; Systems Ownership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ad Hoc Analysis:&lt;/strong&gt; Pull and analyze large datasets from BI tools (e.g., Lightdash) and Google Sheets to answer one-off questions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dashboard Monitoring:&lt;/strong&gt; Monitor existing dashboards for accuracy and flag anomalies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CRM &amp; Data Hygiene:&lt;/strong&gt; Own CRM cleanup and data hygiene (such as deduplicating records, fixing mis-tagged accounts, and keeping partner/referral data reliable).&nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data &amp; Product Request Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Manage the intake and lifecycle of data and product requests from CPMs and the Sr. Director, acting as the point of contact with data/engineering through to resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skill Growth:&lt;/strong&gt; Over time, partner with the data team on more complex analyses and grow into owning dashboards directly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we&#39;re looking for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;2-4+ years of operations/data experience&lt;/strong&gt; in operations, business analysis, or a similar analytical role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Comfortable with ambiguity:&lt;/strong&gt; In this role, you&#39;ll often start with a vague ask and need to dig, talk to people, and scope it yourself.&nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Independent operator:&lt;/strong&gt; Can run a system — a tracker, a dataset, a playbook — end-to-end with minimal oversight.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data fluency:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong Excel/Google Sheets skills (e.g. pivot tables, VLOOKUP) and comfort pulling and structuring large datasets in BI tools (Lightdash, Looker, Tableau, or similar).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder coordination:&lt;/strong&gt; Turns vague asks into well-scoped requests and follows through to resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data-driven execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Uses data to flag anomalies and spot gaps — not just report numbers, but catch what&#39;s wrong with them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clear communicator:&lt;/strong&gt; Translates between CPM field needs, data/engineering priorities, and Sr. Director calls to keep things moving without constant check-ins.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Growth mindset:&lt;/strong&gt; Curious and eager to learn new tools and workflows; captures what you learn so the team benefits.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mission-driven:&lt;/strong&gt; Passionate about improving access to care for underserved populations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High-growth healthtech startup experience preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
