&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;In this role, you will lead the design, development, deployment, and operation of cloud-native infrastructure services that support Truveta’s platform. You will work across container orchestration, service mesh, API gateway infrastructure, workflow orchestration, platform automation, observability, reliability, and security in Azure-based environments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;This opportunity requires strong software engineering fundamentals, hands-on infrastructure expertise, technical leadership, creative problem solving, and proficiency with modern open-source cloud-native technologies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
