&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Lead the design, development, maintenance, and operation of cloud-native infrastructure services for Truveta’s healthcare data platform.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto

&lt;p&gt;Truveta is the world’s first health provider led data platform with a vision of Saving Lives with Data. Our mission is to enable researchers to find cures faster, empower every clinician to be an expert, and help families make the most informed decisions about their care. Achieving Truveta’ s ambitious vision requires an incredible team of talented and inspired people with a special combination of health, software and big data experience who share our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.truveta.com/careers/&quot;&gt;company values&lt;/a&gt;. &nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This position is based out of India (Hyderabad).&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Who We Need&lt;/strong&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Truveta is rapidly building a talented and diverse engineering team to solve complex healthcare and technology challenges. We are seeking a Senior Software Engineer with deep backend services engineering experience and a proven track record of building reliable, scalable, cloud-native systems.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;This role is ideal for an experienced engineer who can design and deliver backend APIs, distributed services, data-driven applications, and platform capabilities using Microsoft Azure and .NET technologies. You will work closely with product managers, architects, security teams, and other engineers to build services that power Truveta’s healthcare data platform.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As a senior engineer, you will also help shape technical direction, drive engineering best practices, mentor other engineers, and contribute to the long-term reliability, scalability, and maintainability of Truveta’s services.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;  &lt;/strong&gt; &nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join the founding team of the Truveta India Development Center (IDC) and play a pivotal role in shaping its future. As one of the initial members, you&#39;ll help build and scale a high-impact organization while contributing to products and platforms that advance healthcare through data and AI. This is a unique opportunity to influence both the technical direction and the culture of a growing global engineering hub.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Patients, doctors, and medical researchers deserve the same cutting-edge technological innovations that have transformed other industries. We are looking for passionate senior software engineers who are excited to apply their backend engineering expertise to help revolutionize healthcare.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;In this role, you will design, develop, test, deploy, and operate cloud-native backend services that support Truveta’s platform. You will build APIs, service integrations, data processing capabilities, and scalable application components using Azure, .NET, and modern engineering practices.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;This opportunity requires strong software engineering fundamentals, technical leadership, creative problem solving, and the ability to build high-quality services that are secure, observable, reliable, and maintainable at scale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the design, development, testing, and maintenance of backend services using C#, .NET, and modern cloud-native architectures.&nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and build RESTful APIs, service integrations, background workers, and data processing components.&nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and operate services that run on Microsoft Azure.&nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with product managers, architects, security teams, and other engineers to define and deliver reliable platform capabilities.&nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make sound technical decisions that balance scalability, performance, security, reliability, and delivery speed.&nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Write clean, maintainable, well-tested code and set a high bar for engineering quality.&nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
