&lt;li&gt;Build secure services that follow engineering best practices for authentication, authorization, data protection, and compliance.&nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve observability through structured logging, metrics, tracing, alerting, and operational dashboards.&nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive service reliability, performance improvements, and operational readiness.&nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor engineers, provide technical guidance, and help improve team practices.&nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Learn and apply domain knowledge related to healthcare data, distributed systems, and large-scale cloud platforms.&nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
