&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science, Software Engineering, a related technical field, or equivalent practical experience.&nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of professional software engineering experience, with significant experience developing backend services, APIs, or cloud-based applications.&nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong hands-on programming experience with C# and .NET/.NET Core.&nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
