malTextRun SCXW266475960 BCX0&quot;&gt;assist&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW266475960 BCX0&quot;&gt;&nbsp;the Clinical Data Management team with local lab and/or external data documentation review and quality control for trial deliverables&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW266475960 BCX0&quot;&gt;.&nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW266475960 BCX0&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP Selected SCXW266475960 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW144508490 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW144508490 BCX0&quot;&gt;Accelerate your skills and career within a fast-growing company while &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW144508490 BCX0&quot;&gt;impacting&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW144508490 BCX0&quot;&gt; the future of healthcare.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW144508490 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335557856&quot;:16777215,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;TextRun SCXW210376148 BCX0&quot; lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;NormalTextRun SCXW210376148 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Strong&quot;&gt;Your day to day:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;EOP SCXW210376148 BCX0&quot; data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;In addition to the duties outlined, performs&nbsp;additional&nbsp;duties and responsibilities based on developing skills and capabilities:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Wingdings&quot; data-listid=&quot;17&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&quot;335

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Maven Clinic is the world&#39;s largest virtual clinic for women and families on a mission to make healthcare work for all of us. Through Maven Enterprise, the company partners with more than 2,300 employers and health plans to provide end-to-end women&#39;s and family health programs spanning fertility and family building, maternity and newborn care, parenting and pediatrics, and menopause and midlife — improving clinical outcomes, reducing healthcare costs, and expanding equitable access to high-quality care at scale. Through its consumer platform, Maven provides direct access to virtual care across 30+ specialties, as well as dedicated hormone and GLP-1 care programs purpose-built for women. Founded in 2014 by CEO Kate Ryder, Maven Clinic has raised more than $425 million from leading healthcare and technology investors including General Catalyst, Sequoia, Dragoneer Investment Group, Oak HC/FT, StepStone Group, Icon Ventures, and Lux Capital. Recognized for innovation and industry leadership, Maven has been named to the TIME100 Most Influential Companies, CNBC Disruptor 50, Fast Company&#39;s Most Innovative Companies, and FORTUNE Best Places to Work. Learn more at mavenclinic.com&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An award-winning culture working towards an important mission –&nbsp; Maven Clinic is a recipient of over 30 workplace and innovation awards, including:&nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;TIME 100 Most Influential Companies (2023, 2026)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fortune Change the World (2024)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CNBC Disruptor 50 List (2022, 2023, 2024)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fortune Best Workplaces for Millennials (2024)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fortune Best Workplaces in Health Care (2024)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fast Company Most Innovative Companies (2020, 2023)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fortune Best Workplaces NY (2020, 2021, 2022, 2023, 2024)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About the role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This isn&#39;t a vertical-specific role. Maven is looking for an experienced decision scientist who works across the seams—connecting clinical product, member experience, and our AI and healthcare initiatives into one coherent story.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll tie the narrative together: building cross-functional reporting that gives every team a shared view of what&#39;s working and why, and partnering on the data architecture that makes the whole team faster. Instead of owning one surface, you&#39;ll work the connective tissue between them—surfacing insights that only appear when you look across the entire experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;re equally at home in the details of measurement and in the big-picture framing that turns data into direction. You know the highest-leverage work often isn&#39;t answering one question well—it&#39;s building the systems and shared language that let everyone answer their own questions better.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;As a Senior Decision Scientist, you will:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own our key cross-functional reports end to end—understanding not just how they&#39;re built but why each metric matters and how the teams that depend on them make decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consolidate fragmented reporting into a coherent, shared view across clinical product, member experience, and our AI and healthcare work, so every team operates from the same source of truth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Surface the insights that only become visible when you look across surfaces rather than within a single one, and translate them into clear direction for stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner on the design of scalable data architecture (primarily using SQL and Python), reducing one-off requests and letting every team answer its own questions faster&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define success metrics with partners across Product, Engineering, and Operations, and pair rigorous measurement with big-picture framing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish the shared language, standards, and best practices that make the whole team faster and sharper—mentoring other analysts along the way&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Minimum Qualifications:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of relevant analytics or data science experience, with a track record of cross-functional or cross-surface work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in SQL, DBT,&nbsp; and a strong background in data visualization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with at least one BI tool (Tableau, Looker)&nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with Python or R&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to design scalable data structures and reporting from both internal and 3rd party sources&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An ability to juggle long-term, strategic projects alongside ad hoc, urgent requests&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent collaboration and communication skills, with a proven ability to turn data into direction for cross-functional stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Preferred Qualifications:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with event-based data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of experimentation and/or statistical modeling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building shared measurement frameworks or semantic/metrics layers used across multiple teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The base salary range for this role is $174,000 - $205,000 per year. You will also be entitled to receive equity and benefits. Individual pay decisions are based on a number of factors, including qualifications for the role, experience level, and skillset.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This role requires active work authorization in the US.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Maven embraces a flexible hybrid work model. Our teams primarily operate from the New York Metropolitan area, NY, and remotely via San Francisco/Bay Area, CA, Seattle, WA. For those in our New York City office, we encourage in-person collaboration by requiring team members to work onsite three days a week&nbsp; (Tuesday, Wednesday, Thursday). For those based in Boston, DC, Chicago, Seattle, and San Francisco, we encourage in-person collaboration by requiring team members to attend monthly Work Together Days within these cities. This policy aims to balance remote work flexibility with the benefits of face-to-face interaction.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;At Maven we believe that a diverse set of backgrounds and experiences enrich our teams and allow us to achieve above and beyond our goals. If you do not have experience in all of the areas detailed above, we hope that you will share your unique background with us in your application and how it can be additive to our teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits That Work For You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our benefits

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Maven Clinic is the world&#39;s largest virtual clinic for women and families on a mission to make healthcare work for all of us. Through Maven Enterprise, the company partners with more than 2,300 employers and health plans to provide end-to-end women&#39;s and family health programs spanning fertility and family building, maternity and newborn care, parenting and pediatrics, and menopause and midlife — improving clinical outcomes, reducing healthcare costs, and expanding equitable access to high-quality care at scale. Through its consumer platform, Maven provides direct access to virtual care across 30+ specialties, as well as dedicated hormone and GLP-1 care programs purpose-built for women. Founded in 2014 by CEO Kate Ryder, Maven Clinic has raised more than $425 million from leading healthcare and technology investors including General Catalyst, Sequoia, Dragoneer Investment Group, Oak HC/FT, StepStone Group, Icon Ventures, and Lux Capital. Recognized for innovation and industry leadership, Maven has been named to the TIME100 Most Influential Companies, CNBC Disruptor 50, Fast Company&#39;s Most Innovative Companies, and FORTUNE Best Places to Work. Learn more at mavenclinic.com&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;An award-winning culture working towards an important mission –&nbsp; Maven Clinic is a recipient of over 30 workplace and innovation awards, including:&nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;TIME 100 Most Influential Companies (2023, 2026)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fortune Change the World (2024)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CNBC Disruptor 50 List (2022, 2023, 2024)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fortune Best Workplaces for Millennials (2024)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fortune Best Workplaces in Health Care (2024)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fast Company Most Innovative Companies (2020, 2023)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fortune Best Workplaces NY (2020, 2021, 2022, 2023, 2024)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Maven is looking for a VP of Business Operations to own the operating engine behind our core business — beginning with one of the most important numbers in the company: enrollments. This role is accountable for driving member enrollment into Maven’s programs across our core business and, by extension, the revenue those enrollments generate. It also owns three central functions that determine how well the rest of the company executes: AI enablement, central operations, and strategy &amp; operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Enrollment is not a single-team problem. It sits at the intersection of nearly every function at Maven, and this role is built for someone who thrives there. You’ll partner daily with Client Success (who own the client relationships that unlock eligible populations), Marketing (member acquisition and lifecycle), Product (enrollment experience and funnel), Finance (targets, forecasting, and unit economics), Data (measurement, segmentation, and attribution), and Clinical and Operations teams. Because so many teams touch enrollment, a core part of the job is holding those cross-functional partners accountable to their piece of the machine — the engine only works when every team delivers its part.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a senior leadership role with a broad and growing remit. You will build, lead, and develop a multi-function organization — including leaders who own member growth, central operations, strategy &amp; ops, and AI enablement — and you will be measured on what those teams collectively deliver. You set the strategy, define the operating cadence, and raise the bar for analytical rigor across a wide cross-functional surface.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re also looking for someone who can expand the definition of the job. A great deal of enrollment optimization work is already underway, but there is not enough strategic thinking about fundamentally new ways to drive enrollments — approaches that don’t simply depend on securing permission to communicate with a client’s employees. You are accountable for ensuring your team finds and opens those new avenues, and for creating the conditions and analytical foundation that let them do it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own member growth for the Core Business:&lt;/strong&gt; Be directly accountable for enrollment targets across Maven’s core business and for the revenue those enrollments drive. Set the strategy, build the plan, and act as a control tower across all cross-functional teams driving revenue to deliver the results quarter over quarter.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build and run a scalable enrollment engine:&lt;/strong&gt; Own the full journey from eligible population to enrolled, activated member — spanning client launches, member acquisition and messaging, the enrollment product experience, and re-engagement of eligible-but-not-enrolled members.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Deliver AI enablement across the organization:&lt;/strong&gt; Own the function that introduces new ways of working with AI at Maven — and, just as importantly, measures them. Build the adoption playbook, instrument usage and impact team by team, and continuously optimize the value the company gets from how Mavens use AI in their day-to-day work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead the central operations team:&lt;/strong&gt; Own the function that enables our member operations and client operations teams to deliver more operationally excellent service. Ensure the systems, tooling, and processes both teams rely on are effective and scalable — built to absorb growth rather than constrain it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead the strategy and operations team:&lt;/strong&gt; Own a central strategy &amp; ops function that brings analytical rigor and operating discipline to teams across the org, with specific focus on partnering with Sales, Client Success, and Payer Growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Optimize relentlessly around data:&lt;/strong&gt; Build and consistently iterate on the funnel, and create systems that enable quick diagnoses of opportunities. Build operational metrics that act as leading KPIs for each team contributing to enrollments and bring quantitative rigor into how teams execute against targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hold the cross-functional machine accountable:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner daily with Client Success, Marketing, Product, Finance, Data, Clinical, Payer, Sales, and Operations — and hold each team accountable to its operational KPIs in the enrollment process. Serve as the connective tissue that keeps every part of the engine delivering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Instrument and forecast:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner with Data and Finance to build the measurement, segmentation, attribution, and forecasting needed to know exactly what is and isn’t working, and to forecast enroll

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 1&quot;&gt;About&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 1&quot;&gt;Truveta&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&quot;134245418&quot;:true,&quot;134245529&quot;:true,&quot;335559738&quot;:360,&quot;335559739&quot;:80}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Truveta is the world’s first health provider-led data platform, with a vision of Saving Lives with Data. Our mission is to enable researchers to find cures faster, empower every clinician to be an expert, and help families make the most informed decisions about their care.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Achieving this vision requires a talented and diverse team with expertise across healthcare, software engineering, cloud infrastructure, data platforms, and artificial intelligence. We are looking for people who are motivated by purposeful work and committed to building technology that can improve healthcare outcomes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;This position is based in &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Hyderabad, India&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 1&quot;&gt;Who&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 1&quot;&gt;We&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 1&quot;&gt;Need&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&quot;134245418&quot;:true,&quot;134245529&quot;:true,&quot;335559738&quot;:360,&quot;335559739&quot;:80}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Truveta is expanding its engineering presence in India to solve complex healthcare and technology challenges at global scale. We are seeking a collaborative and experienced engineering leader who can operate effectively across ambiguity, scale, and evolving requirements.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate combines strong software and infrastructure fundamentals with the ability to build high-performing teams, influence technical direction, and deliver reliable platforms. You should be comfortable balancing hands-on technical leadership with people management and working with distributed teams across India and the United States.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;If you are motivated by purposeful work, enjoy building teams and platforms from the ground up, and want to shape how data, AI, and engineering systems are powered internally, Truveta may be the right fit for you.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 1&quot;&gt;This&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 1&quot;&gt;Opportunity&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&quot;134245418&quot;:true,&quot;134245529&quot;:true,&quot;335559738&quot;:360,&quot;335559739&quot;:80}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We are seeking a Director Of Engineering (POD Lead) to lead the Platform Services team in India.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The Platform Services team will build, manage, and operate the infrastructure that supports engineering teams across India and globally. The team will also own critical backend and platform services, including authentication, authorization, customer and consumer identity and access management, CI/CD, Kubernetes and cloud infrastructure, developer productivity tools, observability, and shared engineering services.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;These services form the backbone of Truveta’s engineering platform and have dependencies across multiple Engineering, Data, Machine Learning, Product, and Security teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;This is a &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;hands-on technical leadership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; role with people-management responsibilities. You will be accountable for technical direction, delivery excellence, platform reliability, and team growth. You will work closely with Product, Technical Program Management, Data, Machine Learning, Security, and Engineering teams in India and the United States.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 1&quot;&gt;What&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 1&quot;&gt;You’ll&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 1&quot;&gt;Do&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&quot;134245418&quot;:true,&quot;134245529&quot;:true,&quot;335559738&quot;:360,&quot;335559739&quot;:80}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;Technical&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;and&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;Platform&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;heading 2&quot;&gt;Leadership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&quot;134245418&quot;:true,&quot;134245529&quot;:true,&quot;335559738&quot;:160,&quot;335559739&quot;:80}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Define and drive the technical vision, architecture, and roadmap for Platform Services and internal engineering platforms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;:1}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Lead the design and implementation of scalable, secure, highly available infrastructure and backend services.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&quot;335551550&quot;:1,&quot;335551620&quot;

&lt;h1&gt;About Truveta&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Truveta is on a mission to save lives with data. We are building the world&#39;s largest and most comprehensive health data platform to accelerate scientific discovery, improve patient care, and enable the next generation of AI-driven healthcare. Our India Development Center (IDC) plays a critical role in scaling our engineering, product, and business operations globally.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As we continue to grow, we are looking for an HR Generalist who is passionate about creating exceptional employee experiences and helping build a high-performing organization.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;The Opportunity&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an HR Generalist, you will support the day-to-day People operations for our growing India Development Center and help manage the employee lifecycle from onboarding through offboarding. You will work closely with employees, managers, and cross-functional teams to ensure smooth HR operations and a positive employee experience. As the IDC continues to scale, you will also provide support for Talent Acquisition activities, including sourcing, interview coordination, candidate engagement, and hiring operations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is an opportunity to gain broad exposure across HR operations, employee engagement, Talent Acquisition, and other People initiatives while helping build and scale our People function in India.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;HR Operations &amp; Employee Lifecycle&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide day-to-day HR support and guidance to employees and managers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage employee lifecycle activities, including onboarding, confirmations, promotions, internal transfers, documentation, and offboarding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver a smooth and engaging onboarding experience for new hires.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate employee records and ensure HR systems are updated in a timely manner.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with Payroll, Finance, IT, and other teams to ensure seamless HR operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support employee queries related to HR policies, processes, benefits, payroll, and other People matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support compliance with company policies, Indian labor laws, and statutory requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to simplify, automate, and improve HR processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Talent Acquisition Support&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the Talent Acquisition function as hiring continues to scale in India.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with sourcing and identifying candidates for open positions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate interviews across candidates, hiring managers, and interview panels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage candidate communication, scheduling, and interview follow-ups.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate candidate information and hiring status in the Applicant Tracking System (ATS).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support offer coordination, pre-joining engagement, and transition of candidates into onboarding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help maintain hiring trackers, reports, and recruitment dashboards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure candidates have a positive and well-coordinated experience throughout the hiring process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Employee Engagement &amp; People Initiatives&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support employee engagement, recognition, wellness, and culture-building programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with employee communications and People-related events and initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support HR projects and organizational initiatives as the India Development Center continues to grow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the broader People team on programs that enhance the overall employee experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Minimum Qualifications&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor&#39;s degree in Human Resources, Business Administration, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MBA/PGDM in Human Resources is preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2–4 years of experience in an HR Generalist or HR Operations role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of HR processes across the employee lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Some exposure to Talent Acquisition, recruitment coordination, or candidate sourcing is preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with HR systems and/or Applicant Tracking Systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication, stakeholder management, and interpersonal skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organizational skills with high attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to handle confidential information with professionalism and integrity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage multiple priorities in a fast-paced and growing environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in a fast-growing technology or product organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to recruiting for technology or engineering roles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to employee engagement, performance management, and HR analytics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of Indian labor laws and statutory compliance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with platforms such as Greenhouse, Workday, BambooHR, or similar HR/ATS systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive, hands-on approach with the ability to work independently as the organization scales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
