&lt;li&gt;Prioritize, multitask, and carry out projects correctly in a timely&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively work with limited direction and/or&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate the ability to exercise independent judgment and&lt;/li&gt;
