&lt;li&gt;Preferably exposed to Salesforce environment for case handling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;u&gt;Roles &amp; Responsibilities&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide support for external customers via email for assistance with questions, education and resolution of problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handle daily case work while meeting predetermined KPI and QA&lt;/li&gt;
