&lt;li&gt;Strong working knowledge of: ICH/GCP guidelines, 21 CFR Part 11, Clinical trial methodologies and lifecycle, CRO and IRT vendor models and EDC platforms (e.g., Medidata Rave)&lt;/li&gt;
