&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Develop, maintain, and operate cloud-native infrastructure services that support Truveta’s healthcare data platform.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Work with Kubernetes-based infrastructure to support scalable, secure, and reliable workloads.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Build and maintain platform capabilities using open-source technologies such as Kubernetes, Conductor, Istio, Kong, and related cloud-native tools.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Support infrastructure and platform services running on Microsoft Azure.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&quot;335559738&quot;:240,&quot;335559739&quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Contribute to automation, tooling, and operational improvements that increase engineering productivity and platform reliability.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&quot;134233117&quot;:false,&quot;134233118&quot;:false,&

