&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Join the founding team of the Truveta India Development Center (IDC) and play a pivotal role in shaping its future. As one of the initial members, you&#39;ll help build and scale a high-impact organization while contributing to products and platforms that advance healthcare through data and AI. This is a unique opportunity to influence both the technical direction and the culture of a growing global engineering hub. This highly visible position will report to our Director of Clinical Intelligence and AI Evaluation team directly and will collaborate closely with engineers, product managers, designers, and ML teams across geographies.&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335557856&quot;:16777215,&quot;335559739&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
