&lt;li&gt;2+ years of experience developing backend services, APIs, or cloud-based applications.&nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on programming experience with C# and .NET/.NET Core.&nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing and building REST APIs, microservices, or distributed backend systems.&nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Microsoft Azure services and cloud-native application development.&nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with relational or NoSQL databases.&nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of software engineering practices including unit testing, code reviews, debugging, source control, and CI/CD.&nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Basic understanding of security concepts such as authentication, authorization, secrets management, and secure API design.&nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong problem-solving skills and ability to learn quickly in a fast-moving engineering environment.&nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effective communication and collaboration skills.&nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
