&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with Azure services.&nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building scalable services using ASP.NET Core, Web API, Entity Framework, or similar frameworks.&nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
