&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;This job requires daily onsite&nbsp;work&nbsp;at our&nbsp;headquarters&nbsp;in&nbsp;Hyderabad.  &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Who&nbsp;we&nbsp;need&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Truveta is rapidly building a talented and diverse team to tackle complex health and technical challenges. We are seeking candidates inspired by the opportunity to securely apply data in the development of real-world health solutions. Beyond core capabilities, we seek problem solvers, passionate and collaborative teammates, and those willing to roll up their sleeves while making a difference. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We do things the right way. Our commitment to security, privacy,&nbsp;and compliance&nbsp;is foundational&nbsp;to the trust our members, customers, and partners place in us.&nbsp;This position is critical to&nbsp;protecting the infrastructure behind the&nbsp;most&nbsp;representative,&nbsp;complete,&nbsp;and&nbsp;timely&nbsp;source of linked patient&nbsp;data in the US.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;If you are interested in the opportunity to pursue purposeful work, join a mission-driven team, and build a rewarding career while having fun, Truveta may be the perfect fit for you. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&quot;134233117&quot;:true,&quot;134233118&quot;:true,&quot;201341983&quot;:0,&quot;335559740&quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
